{"title":"RTRT","artist":"Mili","sourceId":"reference:PAqgvKhiUgqxtyGPAj5W","sourceHash":"461145e0775106aafbaa111a9a0856cf206cab70da983e50d350e38bf95a72f3","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":33663478,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":29.48,"end":36.55,"text":"Hop, hop, you came along my secret laboratory","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":36.55,"end":43.51,"text":"Spiky, spiky bloody fangs hungry for my 气","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":43.51,"end":45.48,"text":"Hold up, mister","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":45.48,"end":47.13,"text":"Right there, mister","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":47.13,"end":48.72,"text":"Sit down, mister","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":48.72,"end":52.34,"text":"How about some retort, pouch of curry?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":52.34,"end":56.07,"text":"Pouch of chili, pouch of M. R. E.","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":56.07,"end":59.87,"text":"But you're rather picky","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":59.87,"end":63.9,"text":"Well, I'll make you something else, don't need to show me how","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":63.9,"end":67.48,"text":"Since I'm the mad scientist, proclaimed by myself","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":67.48,"end":70.92,"text":"广东 or 四川, 江苏 or 湖南","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":70.92,"end":74.72,"text":"No matter which one you pick, I'll get it done","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":74.72,"end":78.28,"text":"炸酱面 and 小笼包, 馄饨 and 叉烧","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":78.28,"end":81.88,"text":"Delivery or takeout won't beat my retort pouch","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":81.88,"end":85.71000000000001,"text":"You're loving my retort, I'm loving your retort","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":85.71000000000001,"end":89.41,"text":"You're my only retort, you're my only retort","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":89.41,"end":96.06,"text":"一 一 ・ 一 二 一 ・ 一 二 三 四 五 六 七","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":96.06,"end":103.14,"text":"一 一 ・ 一 二 一 ・ 一 二 三 四 五 六 七","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":103.14,"end":110.37,"text":"Crack, crack, you stretch your arms out asking for a hug","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":110.37,"end":117.72,"text":"Hidden under your talisman is your practiced smile","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":117.72,"end":119.85,"text":"Come here, mister","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":119.85,"end":121.45,"text":"Help me, mister","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":121.45,"end":123.28,"text":"Right here, mister","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":123.28,"end":125.28,"text":"You took up my spoon","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":125.28,"end":128.56,"text":"Stirring curry, stirring chili","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":128.56,"end":133.47,"text":"That's when I've realized we've became friendly","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":133.47,"end":140.87,"text":"Then he came, a man in black and white, he's holding","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":140.87,"end":147.93,"text":"Laser guns and 八卦 signs","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":147.93,"end":155.11,"text":"Then he aimed at your slimy skin and pulled the","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":155.11,"end":164.06,"text":"Trigger, your head bursts","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":164.06,"end":168.24,"text":"Sh, I'll stitch you back up, don't need to show me how","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":168.24,"end":171.88,"text":"Since I'm the mad scientist, proclaimed by myself","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":171.88,"end":175.46,"text":"I'll give you plastic eyes, and give you nylon hair","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":175.46,"end":179.39,"text":"And I'll make sure I get your talisman repaired shark","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":179.39,"end":183.12,"text":"Fin soup or 点心, dumpling or 北京 duck","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":183.12,"end":186.28,"text":"Nothing I make is gonna bring that charm inside you back","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":186.28,"end":190.14,"text":"But you're still my retort, but you're still my retort","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":190.14,"end":193.99,"text":"I'm seeking for retort, I'm seeking for retort","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}